WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.980
Dr. Von Hildebrandt prepared a set of photocopied
lab notes and research materials regarding

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.760
SCP-914.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.900
These were placed in 914 on the setting "Fine."

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.849
The resulting output was a leather-bound book,
with the title written in gold leaf in an

00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:15.790
old dialect of Finnish.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.180
The contents were identical to the contents
of the original papers.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.800
There was also a leather pocket in the back
cover, containing a modern compact disc.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.890
The data on said disc is encrypted, and the
tech department is currently hard at work

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:28.920
deciphering it.

